  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to boil.<br>• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.<br>• Cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all water is absorbed, 10 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e9140c7b54fefad79/step-40fa0e00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice zucchini into half-moons. Cut capsicum into <br>bite-sized chunks.<br>• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine sweet soy seasoning, the honey, soy sauce and water (for the sauce).<br>• In a small bowl, combine sriracha (add less if you’re sensitive to heat!) and <br>the mayonnaise.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e9140c7b54fefad79/step-bf942f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook <br>capsicum and zucchini, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl.<br>• Return pan to medium-high heat and cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 mins.<br>• Add honey soy mixture and veggies, tossing until well combined, 1 min.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e9140c7b54fefad79/step-c56c6f20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide rice and tofu stir-fry between bowls.<br>• Drizzle with sriracha mayo to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e9140c7b54fefad79/step-68e9b630.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
